// Units: o002 (Toiler), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
The lowest rank of the Horde, Peons are weak but indispensable. Forced into endless labor, they harvest gold and lumber, and raise the structures that sustain the war effort. Downtrodden though they are, the Horde cannot march without them.|n|n|cffffcc00Can harvest gold and lumber, build structures, and Repair.|r|n|n|cffffcc00Attacks land units and trees.|r
}

