STRING 3581
// Units: n009 (Ogre), Ubertip (Tooltip - Extended)
{
Ogres were brought through the Dark Portal by Gul’dan after the First War. Though duller in wit than even peons, these brutish two-headed warriors possess immense strength and endurance, enough to stand against human cavalry.|n|n|cffffcc00Abilities:|r Pillage.|n|cffffcc00Can be upgraded to:|r Ogre Magi.|n|n|cffffcc00Attacks land units.|r
